Upstream Croissant example documents
====================================

The JSON files in this directory are unmodified copies of example metadata from
the MLCommons Croissant repository:

  https://github.com/mlcommons/croissant
  commit 24636299c4ecf80f4c408256b7444712390599ad (main, 2026-11-06)

  v1.1_huggingface-squad_v2.json  <- datasets/1.1/huggingface-squad_v2/metadata.json
  v1.1_huggingface-mnist.json     <- datasets/1.1/huggingface-mnist-from-main-branch/metadata.json
  v1.1_zenodo-head-mri.json       <- datasets/1.1/zenodo-head-mri/metadata.json
  v1.0_titanic.json               <- datasets/1.0/titanic/metadata.json
  v1.0_movielens.json             <- datasets/1.0/movielens/metadata.json
  v0.8_titanic.json               <- datasets/0.8/titanic/metadata.json

Raw URLs have the form
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlcommons/croissant/24636299c4ecf80f4c408256b7444712390599ad/<path>

